# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# .clineignore — EverShelf / Dispensa
#
# Goal: keep Cline's context limited to *source code, docs, tests and
# translation files*. Everything listed below is generated, binary, runtime
# state, third-party code or a local secret: reading it only burns tokens.
#
# Syntax: gitignore-compatible (the `ignore` matcher Cline uses).
#   `pattern/`  → directory, matched at any depth
#   `!pattern`  → re-include something excluded above
#   NOTE: a file cannot be re-included if its *parent directory* is excluded,
#         that is why runtime folders are written as `data/**` and not `data/`.
#
# If a task genuinely needs a file listed here, ask the user before changing
# this file — do not silently edit it.
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Version control internals ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/

# ── Dependencies (third-party code, never hand-edited) ───────────────────────
node_modules/
bower_components/
vendor/

# ── Vendored browser libs: Tesseract, Transformers.js, Quagga, ZBar (~36 MB) ─
assets/vendor/

# ── Build output / minified artefacts (regenerate with `npm run build`) ──────
dist/
build/
out/
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.tsbuildinfo
**/app/build/
**/.gradle/
**/gradle/wrapper/
gradlew
gradlew.bat

# ── Runtime state, caches, database and local backups ────────────────────────
# `data/**` (not `data/`) is what keeps the re-inclusion below possible, and it
# also covers nested folders such as data/mealie/ (cleartext credentials).
# data/seasonal_produce_it.json is SHIPPED SOURCE DATA used by the seasonal
# feature, so it must stay readable.
data/**
!data/seasonal_produce_it.json
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ── Secrets and local machine config (never read, never commit) ──────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
ca.crt
*.crt
*.pem
*.key
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
local.properties
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Binaries / media (never useful as text) ──────────────────────────────────
*.apk
*.aab
*.jar
*.dex
*.class
*.wasm
*.onnx
*.bin
*.zip
*.gz
*.tar
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.ico
*.bmp
*.mp4
*.woff
*.woff2
*.ttf
*.eot

# ── Generated asset dumps and scratch folders ────────────────────────────────
assets/img/
screenshots/
releases/
todo/screenshots/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.map
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# TEMPORARY medicine-read diagnostic (frames + events of the OCR reader)
